- web/src/lib/reader.ts
- web/src/pages/Reader.tsx
(web/src/css/reader.css is optional styling, not required.)

DO NOT modify backend (server/**, proto/**, store/**), .bench/, package.json or any config/dependency file, or any existing test. Do NOT use dangerouslySetInnerHTML.

